      "note": "Today's suggestion uses the mean of today's scans for the station (SpatialAdjustService.cs:3001-3012). Only when there is no scan today does it fall back to the previous day's predicted result, the model carried forward (:3031-3032), so \"yesterday's scan\" describes the fallback rather than the normal case. The write to Lynx happens only when the user pushes (sa-push-changes.service.ts:208).",
      "question": "",
      "developNote": "On develop (bd39f465) the same arithmetic moves into CalculateAdjustment (SpatialAdjustService.cs:3211-3232), and a new pass writes today's adjustment from the carried-forward model on days with no new scan (:3280-3325).",
